       - Orientation/Scale: B
    3. Compare with exact field via Calculator:
       - mag(B - B_analytical) gives the pointwise error

  Alternative: Individual files
    - magnetostatics_01_straight_wire_A.xdmf (vector potential)
    - magnetostatics_01_straight_wire_B.xdmf (magnetic field)
    - magnetostatics_01_straight_wire_B_analytical.xdmf (exact field)
    Each also carries the mesh and the CellTags array.

